g architecture and curated designer furniture suggest a narrative of private luxury and effortless elegance, positioning the subject within a space of elite comfort.", "post_processing": "Fine-grained texture retention (ISO 100-like clarity); subtle lens bloom around the chandelier; high dynamic range preserving details in the white dress highlights and the shadowed floor reflections.", "aesthetic_constraints": "Avoid 'AI plastic' skin; preserve natural dermal pores, fine skin folds, and anatomical realism in the feet; maintain natural asymmetry in hair flow; ensure the marble veins are non-repetitive." }

